# Measurements System & Dynamic Field Rendering

## Core Component: [components/MeasurementsPage.tsx](mdc:components/MeasurementsPage.tsx)

The measurements page is the most complex component, handling dynamic field rendering, SVG updates, and real-time calculations.

## Key Features

### Dynamic Field System
- **Database-Driven**: Fields are fetched from `layout_fields` table based on selected layout
- **Field Types**: manual, auto_calculated, sink, backsplash
- **Real-time Updates**: Measurements update SVG labels immediately
- **Validation**: Required fields and data type validation

### SVG Rendering System
- **Dynamic Labels**: SVG text elements are replaced with current measurement values
- **Database-First**: SVG images prioritized from database `layout_image` field
- **Fallback System**: Local assets used when database images unavailable
- **Performance**: SVG content cached, only text labels updated

### Image Management in [data/shapeImageMap.ts](mdc:data/shapeImageMap.ts)

#### PNG Images (Shape Selection)
```typescript
export function getShapePngImage(layoutName: string): string {
  const pngFallbackMap: Record<string, string> = {
    'SingleWall': '/assets/images/SingleWall.png',
    'LShape': '/assets/images/LShape.png',
    // ... other mappings
  };
  return pngFallbackMap[layoutName] || '/assets/images/LShape.png';
}
```

#### SVG Images (Measurements)
```typescript
export function getShapeSvgImage(layoutName: string, layoutImage?: string): string {
  // Prioritize database image URL
  if (layoutImage && layoutImage.trim() !== '') {
    return layoutImage;
  }
  // Fallback to local SVG assets
  const svgFallbackMap: Record<string, string> = {
    'SingleWall': '/assets/images/SingleWall.svg',
    'LShape': '/assets/images/LShape.svg',
    // ... other mappings
  };
  return svgFallbackMap[layoutName] || '/assets/images/LShape.svg';
}
```

